{"questions":[{"id":"p00001","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"eye\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["눈(신체)","남자","연필","큰"],"answer":0,"level":1},{"id":"p00002","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"see\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["눈(날씨)","방","보다","초록의"],"answer":2,"level":1},{"id":"p00003","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"pencil\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["가족","큰","읽다","연필"],"answer":3,"level":1},{"id":"p00004","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"slow\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["원하다","느린","개","새로운"],"answer":1,"level":1},{"id":"p00005","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"go\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["노래하다","가다","머리카락","차가운"],"answer":1,"level":1},{"id":"p00006","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"jump\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["슬픈","우유","점프하다","문"],"answer":2,"level":1},{"id":"p00007","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"hello\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["안녕하세요","둘","밥","달리다"],"answer":0,"level":1},{"id":"p00008","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"school\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["달","공","책상","학교"],"answer":3,"level":1},{"id":"p00009","type":"mcq","prompt":"I ___ a student.","choices":["are","is","am","be"],"answer":2,"explain":"be동사는 주어마다 짝이 정해져 있어요: I→am, He/She/It→is, You/We/They→are.\n✔ I am a student. (나는 학생이에요)\n✘ is는 He/She/It 전용, are는 You/We/They 전용이라 I와 못 써요. be 원형은 will be처럼 조동사 뒤에서만 써요.","level":1},{"id":"p00010","type":"mcq","prompt":"She ___ my sister.","choices":["is","are","be","am"],"answer":0,"explain":"She는 3인칭 단수라 is와 짝이에요.\n✔ She is my sister. (그녀는 내 여동생이에요)\n✘ am은 오직 I 전용, are는 You/We/They 전용. be는 혼자 문장의 동사로 못 서요.","level":1},{"id":"p00011","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"winter\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["물어보다","동물원","겨울","노래"],"answer":2,"level":2},{"id":"p00012","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"minute\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["대답하다","음악","바람","분"],"answer":3,"level":2},{"id":"p00013","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"clean\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["봄","바다","원숭이","청소하다"],"answer":3,"level":2},{"id":"p00014","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"bathroom\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["원숭이","화장실","가끔","세계"],"answer":1,"level":2},{"id":"p00015","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"help\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["설탕","호랑이","돕다","알다"],"answer":2,"level":2},{"id":"p00016","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"find\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["수영하다","점심","찾다","시간"],"answer":2,"level":2},{"id":"p00017","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"answer\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["해변","대답하다","선물","생일"],"answer":1,"level":2},{"id":"p00018","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"season\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["계절","대답하다","찾다","주스"],"answer":0,"level":2},{"id":"p00019","type":"mcq","prompt":"There ___ many stars in the sky.","choices":["are","was","is","am"],"answer":0,"explain":"뒤의 명사가 many stars(복수)라서 are를 써요. There is/are는 '뒤에 오는 명사'에 수를 맞춰요.\n✔ There are many stars. / There is one star.\n✘ is는 단수용. was는 과거인데 이 문장은 현재 상태라 안 맞아요.","level":2},{"id":"p00020","type":"mcq","prompt":"She ___ TV last night.","choices":["watching","watches","watch","watched"],"answer":3,"explain":"last night(어젯밤)이 있으면 과거 시제! 규칙동사는 -ed를 붙여요.\n✔ She watched TV last night.\n✘ watches/watch는 현재형이라 last night과 충돌해요. watching은 was watching처럼 be동사가 필요해요.","level":2},{"id":"p00021","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"holiday\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["일기","간호사","휴일","끝내다"],"answer":2,"level":3},{"id":"p00022","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"letter\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["편지","돈","유명한","방학"],"answer":0,"level":3},{"id":"p00023","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"diary\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["즐기다","농부","일기","수학"],"answer":2,"level":3},{"id":"p00024","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"try\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["교실","가장 좋아하는","노력하다","걱정하다"],"answer":2,"level":3},{"id":"p00025","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"magazine\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["조용한","노력하다","잡지","빌리다"],"answer":2,"level":3},{"id":"p00026","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"exciting\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["목도리","자주","신나는","치마"],"answer":2,"level":3},{"id":"p00027","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"loud\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["받다","시끄러운","중요한","준비된"],"answer":1,"level":3},{"id":"p00028","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"jacket\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["학년","재킷","간호사","문제"],"answer":1,"level":3},{"id":"p00029","type":"mcq","prompt":"I have ___ my homework already.","choices":["finish","finishing","finishes","finished"],"answer":3,"explain":"have+과거분사 = 현재완료(이미 ~했다). already(이미)와 잘 어울려요.\n✔ I have finished my homework already.\n✘ have finish/finishing/finishes는 문법 위반 — have 뒤 완료형은 반드시 과거분사(p.p.)예요.","level":3},{"id":"p00030","type":"mcq","prompt":"She has ___ in Seoul since 2020.","choices":["lived","live","lives","living"],"answer":0,"explain":"since 2020(2020년부터 지금까지)은 현재완료의 신호! has+과거분사.\n✔ She has lived in Seoul since 2020. (지금도 살고 있음)\n✘ has live/lives는 불가, has living은 has been living이라면 가능하지만 living 단독으로는 틀려요.","level":3},{"id":"p00031","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"wonderful\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["섬","훌륭한","문화","영웅"],"answer":1,"level":4},{"id":"p00032","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"forest\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["짓다","바꾸다","행성","숲"],"answer":3,"level":4},{"id":"p00033","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"discover\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["멈추다","곤란","가입하다","발견하다"],"answer":3,"level":4},{"id":"p00034","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"stranger\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["외국인","창조하다","낯선 사람","디자인하다"],"answer":2,"level":4},{"id":"p00035","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"introduce\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["디자인하다","완벽한","소개하다","자라다"],"answer":2,"level":4},{"id":"p00036","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"proud\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["선택","섬","자랑스러운","일어나다"],"answer":2,"level":4},{"id":"p00037","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"exit\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["출구","숲","결과","동아리"],"answer":0,"level":4},{"id":"p00038","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"respect\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["동의하다","존중하다","실수","안전한"],"answer":1,"level":4},{"id":"p00039","type":"mcq","prompt":"I have been ___ English for three years.","choices":["to study","studied","studying","study"],"answer":2,"explain":"have been+~ing = 현재완료진행(3년째 쭉 공부해 오는 중). 계속성을 강조해요.\n✔ I have been studying English for three years.\n✘ have been studied는 수동태가 되어 '내가 공부당했다'는 이상한 뜻이 돼요.","level":4},{"id":"p00040","type":"mcq","prompt":"By the time we arrived, the movie ___ started.","choices":["has already","have already","already","had already"],"answer":3,"explain":"우리가 도착한 것(과거)보다 영화 시작이 더 먼저 → 과거완료 had+p.p.\n✔ The movie had already started. (도착 전에 이미 시작돼 있었다)\n✘ has started는 현재완료라 과거 기준점(arrived)과 안 맞아요.","level":4},{"id":"p00041","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"achievement\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["모이다","목표","업적","불평하다"],"answer":2,"level":5},{"id":"p00042","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"suffer\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["참석하다","공급하다","필요로 하다","고통받다"],"answer":3,"level":5},{"id":"p00043","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"spend\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["통제하다","전통","쓰다(시간·돈)","관계"],"answer":2,"level":5},{"id":"p00044","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"condition\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["불평하다","버릇","주문하다","상태"],"answer":3,"level":5},{"id":"p00045","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"achieve\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["성취하다","발전시키다","기대하다","필요로 하다"],"answer":0,"level":5},{"id":"p00046","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"recently\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["최근에","다양한","용기","완료하다"],"answer":0,"level":5},{"id":"p00047","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"donate\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["세계적인","기부하다","숨다","사회"],"answer":1,"level":5},{"id":"p00048","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"encourage\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["알아차리다","기부하다","교육하다","격려하다"],"answer":3,"level":5},{"id":"p00049","type":"mcq","prompt":"If I ___ rich, I would travel the world.","choices":["am","be","were","will be"],"answer":2,"explain":"가정법 과거: 현재 사실의 반대 상상은 If+과거형, 주절엔 would. be동사는 인칭 무관 were!\n✔ If I were rich, I would travel. (실제론 부자가 아님)\n✘ If I am rich면 단순 조건(정말 그럴 수도)이 되고, will be는 If절에 못 들어가요.","level":5},{"id":"p00050","type":"mcq","prompt":"If I had studied, I ___ the test.","choices":["passed","would pass","will pass","would have passed"],"answer":3,"explain":"가정법 과거완료: 과거 사실의 반대는 If+had p.p., 주절은 would have p.p.\n✔ If I had studied, I would have passed. (실제론 공부 안 해서 떨어짐)\n✘ would pass는 가정법 과거(현재 반대)라 시제 짝이 안 맞아요.","level":5},{"id":"p00051","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"attract\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["무시하다","대표하다","퍼지다","끌어들이다"],"answer":3,"level":6},{"id":"p00052","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"release\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["풀어주다","신뢰하다","끌어들이다","방해하다"],"answer":0,"level":6},{"id":"p00053","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"scold\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["사과하다","이끌다","고집하다","꾸짖다"],"answer":3,"level":6},{"id":"p00054","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"advertise\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["신뢰하다","파괴하다","가라앉다","광고하다"],"answer":3,"level":6},{"id":"p00055","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"cheer\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["다가가다","감사하다","응원하다","공연하다"],"answer":2,"level":6},{"id":"p00056","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"earn\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["벌다","긴장을 풀다","다치게 하다","응답하다"],"answer":0,"level":6},{"id":"p00057","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"lead\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["녹다","신뢰하다","이끌다","비판하다"],"answer":2,"level":6},{"id":"p00058","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"atmosphere\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["인정하다","대기","포함시키다","탈출하다"],"answer":1,"level":6},{"id":"p00059","type":"mcq","prompt":"Scarcely ___ the station when the train left.","choices":["I had reached","I reached had","did I reached","had I reached"],"answer":3,"explain":"Scarcely had+주어+p.p. ~ when... = ~하자마자 …했다. 부정어가 앞에 오면 도치!\n✔ Scarcely had I reached the station when the train left.\n✘ Scarcely I had reached는 도치를 안 해서 틀려요.","level":6},{"id":"p00060","type":"mcq","prompt":"Not until yesterday ___ the truth.","choices":["I learned","learned I","I did learn","did I learn"],"answer":3,"explain":"Not until ~이 문장 앞에 오면 주절이 조동사+주어로 도치돼요.\n✔ Not until yesterday did I learn the truth. (어제서야 알았다)\n✘ Not until yesterday I learned는 도치 누락 — 부정어 전치 = 도치 신호!","level":6},{"id":"p00061","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"capable\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["적응하다","보조하다","유능한","보상하다"],"answer":2,"level":7},{"id":"p00062","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"cause\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["원인","작곡하다","인용하다","십 년"],"answer":0,"level":7},{"id":"p00063","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"argument\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["논쟁","건설하다","배정하다","기준"],"answer":0,"level":7},{"id":"p00064","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"detect\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["극적인","적절한","감지하다","분배하다"],"answer":2,"level":7},{"id":"p00065","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"complex\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["복잡한","끊임없는","승인하다","유대"],"answer":0,"level":7},{"id":"p00066","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"collapse\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["붕괴하다","분배하다","배정하다","헌신하다"],"answer":0,"level":7},{"id":"p00067","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"bear\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["가정하다","제거하다","견디다","분석하다"],"answer":2,"level":7},{"id":"p00068","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"construct\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["결정적인","건설하다","불안한","기초"],"answer":1,"level":7},{"id":"p00069","type":"mcq","prompt":"The report, ___ errors, was sent back.","choices":["fill with","full of","filled to","fully"],"answer":1,"explain":"full of = ~로 가득한 (형용사구가 명사를 뒤에서 수식).\n✔ The report, (which was) full of errors, was sent back.\n✘ filled라면 filled with로 써야 해요(filled to ✗). fully는 부사라 명사를 수식 못 해요.","level":7},{"id":"p00070","type":"mcq","prompt":"___ is often the case, he was late.","choices":["As","What","Which","It"],"answer":0,"explain":"As is often the case = 흔히 그렇듯이. 이 As는 문장 전체를 받는 유사관계대명사예요.\n✔ As is often the case, he was late.\n✘ It/What으로 시작하면 뒤 문장과 연결이 안 돼요. Which는 문장 앞에 못 서요.","level":7},{"id":"p00071","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"infer\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["평가하다","추론하다","물려받다","논리적인"],"answer":1,"level":8},{"id":"p00072","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"facility\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["성숙한","시설","초과하다","집행하다"],"answer":1,"level":8},{"id":"p00073","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"modify\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["수정하다","전시하다","빈번한","재정"],"answer":0,"level":8},{"id":"p00074","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"legend\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["빈번한","조사하다","전설","추정하다"],"answer":2,"level":8},{"id":"p00075","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"instruct\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["지시하다","가설","조사하다","진화하다"],"answer":0,"level":8},{"id":"p00076","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"immediate\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["여백","극단적인","즉각적인","협상하다"],"answer":2,"level":8},{"id":"p00077","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"fee\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["전체의","노동","요금","주도권"],"answer":2,"level":8},{"id":"p00078","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"mature\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["평가하다","성숙한","전체의","이전의"],"answer":1,"level":8},{"id":"p00079","type":"mcq","prompt":"___ the complexity of the issue, a quick fix is unlikely.","choices":["Give","Given","Giving","To give"],"answer":1,"explain":"Given+명사 = ~을 고려하면 (관용 분사 전치사).\n✔ Given the complexity, a quick fix is unlikely.\n✘ Giving은 '주면서'라는 능동 진행이 되어 어색해요. Given은 굳어진 표현으로 암기!","level":8},{"id":"p00080","type":"mcq","prompt":"The evidence, ___ carefully, points to a different cause.","choices":["examine","examining","to examine","examined"],"answer":3,"explain":"증거는 '검토되는' 대상 → 수동 분사구문 (being) examined.\n✔ The evidence, (when) examined carefully, points to...\n✘ examining이면 증거가 스스로 검토하는 능동이 돼요. 분사 뒤 목적어가 없으면 수동 신호!","level":8},{"id":"p00081","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"outcome\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["설문조사","설비","직원","성과"],"answer":3,"level":9},{"id":"p00082","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"employee\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["초과 근무","설명서","직원","유효한"],"answer":2,"level":9},{"id":"p00083","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"candidate\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["배당금","대출","협약","후보자"],"answer":3,"level":9},{"id":"p00084","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"prompt\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["갱신하다","동봉하다","회계 감사","신속한"],"answer":3,"level":9},{"id":"p00085","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"renew\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["협상","갱신하다","장비","수익"],"answer":1,"level":9},{"id":"p00086","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"survey\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["등록하다","행사장","직업","설문조사"],"answer":3,"level":9},{"id":"p00087","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"warranty\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["품질 보증","할인","제안서","직원(전체)"],"answer":0,"level":9},{"id":"p00088","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"commission\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["이체하다","이익","구매하다","수수료"],"answer":3,"level":9},{"id":"p00089","type":"mcq","prompt":"Please find ___ the requested documents.","choices":["attached","attachment of","attach","attaching"],"answer":0,"explain":"Please find attached ~ = 첨부한 ~을 확인해 주세요 (비즈니스 이메일 정형 표현, 문서가 '첨부된' 수동).\n✔ Please find attached the requested documents.\n✘ attaching이면 문서가 스스로 첨부하는 능동이 돼요.","level":9},{"id":"p00090","type":"mcq","prompt":"We would appreciate ___ prompt reply.","choices":["yourself","yours","your","you"],"answer":2,"explain":"appreciate+소유격+명사: '당신의 신속한 답장'이니 your.\n✔ We would appreciate your prompt reply.\n✘ appreciate you reply는 어법 위반. yours는 뒤에 명사를 못 데려와요(이미 '당신의 것'이란 뜻).","level":9},{"id":"p00091","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"deduce\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["유전의","연역하다","그 후의","구성하다"],"answer":1,"level":10},{"id":"p00092","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"implement\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["구성하다","시행하다","미적인","유전의"],"answer":1,"level":10},{"id":"p00093","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"induce\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["유행병","유도하다","조작하다","언어의"],"answer":1,"level":10},{"id":"p00094","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"nuance\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["저하시키다","자세히 설명하다","미묘한 차이","지각하다"],"answer":2,"level":10},{"id":"p00095","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"embed\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["깊이 박다","직관","모순되다","흩어지다"],"answer":0,"level":10},{"id":"p00096","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"rigorous\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["엄격한","포식자","고고학","딜레마"],"answer":0,"level":10},{"id":"p00097","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"photosynthesis\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["파편","광합성","구성하다","진실성"],"answer":1,"level":10},{"id":"p00098","type":"mcq","prompt":"\"constrain\" 의 뜻은?","choices":["제약하다","전망","현상","지속하다"],"answer":0,"level":10},{"id":"p00099","type":"mcq","prompt":"The results, ___ statistically significant, have limited practical value.","choices":["while","unless","despite","because"],"answer":0,"explain":"while+형용사 = ~이긴 하지만 (양보 축약절: while they are significant).\n✔ The results, while statistically significant, have limited value. (유의미하긴 하지만)\n✘ despite는 전치사라 형용사만 못 받고, because면 인과가 어색해요.","level":10},{"id":"p00100","type":"mcq","prompt":"___ such conditions, cooperation becomes essential.","choices":["By","Under","On","At"],"answer":1,"explain":"under conditions/circumstances = ~한 조건·상황에서. 조건은 under와 짝!\n✔ Under such conditions, cooperation becomes essential.\n✘ on/at/by conditions는 관용적으로 쓰지 않아요.","level":10}]}